      "default": "<h3><strong>YOU ASKED</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_SZD3qNA7JnweMt8P",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "<h3><strong>WE ANSWERED</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Nv1ljtkz4sDmGmWw",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p><strong>What does flavored air taste like?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_LanflmYipclD5NIT",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>If you’re used to vapor, Lio might feel lighter at first—but it’s designed for a healthier future. Think of Lio as herbal tea compared to the sticky soda of vapor: less intense, more natural, and far better for you.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_7oZp1QeaN2zcXw1p",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>Is Lio safe to use?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_LIyTCwqfE0h4I0ez",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients and is completely free from nicotine, smoke, and harmful chemicals, making it a safe and healthier alternative for people trying to quit smoking or vaping.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_RVXAnCL1Z9GxTX5P",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_QuIeiZdGhSs1eRJb",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Use Lio as often as you like. If you experience any discomfort, please discontinue use and consult your physician.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_hRnitBSbZNSz1UrE",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>Can I use Lio anywhere?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YigB01InfjfwYRyR",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>Yes! Lio produces no smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals, so it can be used in most places where smoking or vaping are not allowed. Its discreet and clean design makes it a convenient, portable option to carry and use anywhere, whether you’re at home, work, or on the go.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_FT7TkP1ZAoEzAMuT",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>What are cores made of?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_vOTWEg9EhTGUQxb7",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Core fiber is medical grade polyester, infused in the fiber is our unique plant blend of pure essential oils from amazing farms we&apos;ve partnered with around the world.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_x9hYxVOwVQLb0Y8d",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "default": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>"
    },
